rom saying it, even if it is not appropriate for the situation.","2":"40","3":"10","4":"30","5":"40","6":"30","7":"50","8":"10","9":"30","10":"40","11":"20","12":"40","13":"40","14":"40","15":"30","16":"30","17":"20","18":"50","19":"10","20":"40","21":"20","22":"40","23":"40","24":"40","25":"30","26":"10","27":"50","28":"50","29":"30","30":"50","31":"30","32":"40","33":"10","34":"20","35":"30","36":"40","37":"10","38":"30","39":"30","40":"20","41":"50","42":"40","43":"50","44":"40","45":"40","46":"40","47":"20","48":"40","49":"40","50":"50","51":"40","52":"20","53":"40","54":"40","55":"10","56":"50","57":"40","58":"40","59":"10","60":"30","61":"30"},"20":{"1":"I often go overboard in putting myself down when i am making jokes or trying to be funny.","2":"10","3":"20","4":"30","5":"10","6":"40","7":"30","8":"10","9":"20","10":"30","11":"20","12":"10","13":"20","14":"10","15":"30","16":"20","17":"10","18":"40","19":"20","20":"20","21":"30","22":"20","23":"10","24":"30","25":"10","26":"10","27":"20","28":"40","29":"30","30":"20","31":"10","32":"10","33":"10","34":"10","35":"20","36":"10","37":"10","38":"10","39":"10","40":"40","41":"10","42":"30","43":"30","44":"30","45":"10","46":"20","47":"10","48":"20","49":"40","50":"40","51":"10","52":"10","53":"10","54":"20","55":"10","56":"40","57":"40","58":"10","59":"10","60":"20","61":"40"},"21":{"1":"I enjoy making people laugh.","2":"40","3":"40","4":"30","5":"50","6":"50","7":"20","8":"10","9":"40","10":"50","11":"30","12":"50","13":"50","14":"10","15":"30","16":"40","17":"50","18":"30","19":"40","20":"50","21":"50","22":"50","23":"30","24":"50","25":"50","26":"50","27":"50","28":"50","29":"50","30":"50","31":"50","32":"40","33":"20","34":"50","35":"50","36":"40","37":"40","38":"50","39":"50","40":"50","41":"50","42":"50","43":"50","44":"50","45":"50","46":"50","47":"50","48":"50","49":"40","50":"50","51":"50","52":"50","53":"50","54":"50","55":"10","56":"50","57":"40","58":"50","59":"40","60":"40","61":"50"},"22":{"1":"If i am feeling sad or upset, i usually lose my sense of humor.","2":"30","3":"50","4":"30","5":"50","6":"10","7":"20","8":"10","9":"30","10":"30","11":"20","12":"20","13":"40","14":"40","15":"20","16":"30","17":"50","18":"20","19":"30","20":"50","21":"40","22":"40","23":"40","24":"20","25":"30","26":"50","27":"10","28":"50","29":"40","30":"40","31":"30","32":"40","33":"50","34":"40","35":"20","36":"50","37":"20","38":"30","39":"40","40":"40","41":"20","42":"20","43":"20","44":"30","45":"40","46":"20","47":"30","48":"20","49":"40","50":"20","51":"10","52":"40","53":"30","54":"20","55":"40","56":"20","57":"20","58":"20","59":"30","60":"30","61":"20"},"23":{"1":"I never participate in laughing at others even if all my friends are doing it.","2":"30","3":"20","4":"20","5":"10","6":"10","7":"20","8":"10","9":"40","10":"40","11":"20","12":"30","13":"30","14":"30","15":"30","16":"30","17":"20","18":"10","19":"30","20":"30","21":"20","22":"30","23":"30","24":"50","25":"40","26":"20","27":"10","28":"10","29":"40","30":"10","31":"50","32":"20","33":"50","34":"40","35":"20","36":"50","37":"50","38":"20","39":"20","40":"40","41":"30","42":"30","43":"20","44":"20","45":"10","46":"10","47":"40","48":"20","49":"30","50":"20","51":"20","52":"20","53":"10","54":"20","55":"40","56":"10","57":"20","58":"30","59":"20","60":"40","61":"10"},"24":{"1":"When i am with friends or family, i often seem to be the one that other people make fun of or joke about.","2":"10","3":"30","4":"20","5":"10","6":"20","7":"30","8":"10","9":"20","10":"30","11":"30","12":"20","13":"20","14":"30","15":"50","16":"20","17":"30","18":"30","19":"10","20":"20","21":"10","22":"20","23":"10","24":"20","25":"10","26":"10","27":"10","28":"50","29":"30","30":"30","31":"10","32":"20","33":"10","34":"20","35":"10","36":"20","37":"20","38":"30","39":"20","40":"40","41":"30","42":"30","43":"20","44":"20","45":"40","46":"20","47":"10","48":"20","49":"40","50":"20","51":"10","52":"10","53":"30","54":"20","55":"10","56":"40","57":"50","58":"10","59":"20","60":"10","61":"30"},"25":{"1":"I don\u2019t often joke around with my friends.","2":"10","3":"20","4":"20","5":"10","6":"20","7":"20","8":"10","9":"30","10":"10","11":"20","12":"10","13":"10","14":"50","15":"30","16":"20","17":"20","18":"10","19":"30","20":"10","21":"10","22":"10","23":"40","24":"10","25":"10","26":"10","27":"10","28":"10","29":"10","30":"10","31":"10","32":"30","33":"20","34":"10","35":"10","36":"10","37":"20","38":"10","39":"10","40":"10","41":"10","42":"10","43":"10","44":"10","45":"10","46":"10","47":"10","48":"10","49":"20","50":"10","51":"10","52":"10","53":"20","54":"10","55":"10","56":"10","57":"20","58":"10","59":"40","60":"10","61":"10"},"26":{"1":"It is my experience that thinking about some amusing aspect of a situation is often a very effective way of coping with problems.","2":"10","3":"10","4":"30","5":"30","6":"20","7":"30","8":"10","9":"20","10":"40","11":"40","12":"30","13":"30","14":"10","15":"30","16":"30","17":"20","18":"30","19":"40","20":"10","21":"50","22":"30","23":"30","24":"40","25":"30","26":"10","27":"40","28":"30","29":"30","30":"30","31":"50","32":"30","33":"10","34":"10","35":"50","36":"30","37":"40","38":"50","39":"50","40":"40","41":"40","42":"40","43":"50","44":"50","45":"40","46":"50","47":"30","48":"40","49":"20","50":"30","51":"40","52":"50","53":"40","54":"50","55":"40","56":"20","57":"40","58":"50","59":"20","60":"40","61":"50"},"27":{"1":"If i don\u2019t like someone, i often use humor or teasing to put them down.","2":"10","3":"10","4":"20","5":"10","6":"20","7":"40","8":"10","9":"10","10":"10","11":"20","12":"10","13":"40","14":"40","15":"40","16":"40","17":"40","18":"20","19":"40","20":"30","21":"40","22":"10","23":"40","24":"10","25":"10","26":"10","27":"50","28":"50","29":"20","30":"20","31":"10","32":"10","33":"20","34":"10","35":"40","36":"10","37":"10","38":"40","39":"50","40":"20","41":"10","42":"30","43":"40","44":"50","45":"50","46":"10","47":"20","48":"40","49":"30","50":"40","51":"40","52":"10","53":"10","54":"20","55":"10","56":"50","57":"40","58":"10","59":"10","60":"10","61":"40"},"28":{"1":"If i am having problems or feeling unhappy, i often cover it up by joking around, so that even my closest friends don\u2019t know how i really feel.","2":"10","3":"10","4":"30","5":"20","6":"50","7":"20","8":"10","9":"30","10":"20","11":"40","12":"20","13":"50","14":"10","15":"30","16":"40","17":"50","18":"50","19":"20","20":"50","21":"20","22":"20","23":"10","24":"40","25":"30","26":"10","27":"50","28":"40","29":"30","30":"50","31":"30","32":"40","33":"10","34":"10","35":"30","36":"20","37":"40","38":"30","39":"50","40":"50","41":"20","42":"30","43":"50","44":"40","45":"50","46":"20","47":"20","48":"40","49":"40","50":"50","51":"40","52":"30","53":"30","54":"40","55":"40","56":"30","57":"40","58":"20","59":"10","60":"20","61":"50"},"29":{"1":"I usually can\u2019t think of witty things to say when i\u2019m with other people.","2":"30","3":"40","4":"30","5":"20","6":"40","7":"50","8":"10","9":"40","10":"20","11":"40","12":"10","13":"20","14":"10","15":"30","16":"20","17":"20","18":"20","19":"20","20":"40","21":"10","22":"20","23":"30","24":"20","25":"10","26":"10","27":"10","28":"40","29":"10","30":"40","31":"20","32":"50","33":"20","34":"50","35":"20","36":"30","37":"20","38":"20","39":"10","40":"30","41":"20","42":"20","43":"20","44":"20","45":"20","46":"30","47":"20","48":"10","49":"30","50":"10","51":"10","52":"10","53":"20","54":"10","55":"50","56":"10","57":"20","58":"10","59":"10","60":"20","61":"20"},"30":{"1":"I don\u2019t need to be with other people to feel amused \u2013 i can usually find things to laugh about even when i\u2019m by myself.","2":"30","3":"30","4":"30","5":"30","6":"40","7":"50","8":"10","9":"40","10":"50","11":"40","12":"50","13":"50","14":"50","15":"30","16":"40","17":"40","18":"40","19":"50","20":"50","21":"40","22":"40","23":"50","24":"50","25":"40","26":"10","27":"40","28":"20","29":"10","30":"50","31":"50","32":"20","33":"30","34":"50","35":"50","36":"50","37":"30","38":"50","39":"50","40":"20","41":"50","42":"40","43":"40","44":"40","45":"40","46":"50","47":"50","48":"40","49":"20","50":"50","51":"40","52":"50","53":"40","54":"50","55":"30","56":"50","57":"40","58":"50","59":"40","60":"40","61":"50"},"31":{"1":"Even if something is really funny to me, i will not laugh or joke about it if someone will be offended.","2":"10","3":"20","4":"20","5":"20","6":"30","7":"20","8":"10","9":"30","10":"30","11":"40","12":"20","13":"20","14":"10","15":"20","16":"30","17":"30","18":"10","19":"30","20":"40","21":"40","22":"20","23":"20","24":"30","25":"40","26":"30","27":"10","28":"10","29":"30","30":"50","31":"50","32":"30","33":"20","34":"50","35":"20","36":"50","37":"50","38":"10","39":"30","40":"40","41":"30","42":"30","43":"10","44":"20","45":"10","46":"10","47":"20","48":"10","49":"30","50":"10","51":"30","52":"50","53":"30","54":"30","55":"40","56":"10","57":"30","58":"30","59":"50","60":"40","61":"10"},"32":{"1":"Letting others laugh at me is my way of keeping my friends and family in good spirits.","2":"10","3":"10","4":"30","5":"10","6":"50","7":"20","8":"10","9":"20","10":"20","11":"30","12":"10","13":"30","14":"10","15":"30","16":"20","17":"30","18":"30","19":"20","20":"30","21":"20","22":"40","23":"10","24":"20","25":"20","26":"10","27":"30","28":"40","29":"40","30":"20","31":"10","32":"10","33":"10","34":"10","35":"10","36":"20","37":"40","38":"40","39":"10","40":"50","41":"20","42":"30","43":"40","44":"50","45":"30","46":"50","47":"30","48":"40","49":"40","50":"40","51":"50","52":"10","53":"30","54":"30","55":"10","56":"50","57":"50","58":"20","59":"10","60":"20","61":"40"}},"Randomization":"All"}}},"79":{"Type":"Standard","SubType":"","Description":"Test","ID":"BL_emR3Nfls9rXrBFc","Options":{"BlockLocking":false,"RandomizeQuestions":"false","BlockVisibility":"Collapsed","Looping":"Static","LoopingOptions":{"Static":{"1":{"1":"I have a vivid imagination.","2":""},"2":{"1":"I hold a grudge.","2":""},"3":{"1":"I do not mind being the centre of attention.","2":""},"4":{"1":"I do not like poetry.","2":""},"5":{"1":"I complete tasks successfully.","2":""},"6":{"1":"I believe that others have good intentions.","2":""},"7":{"1":"I avoid philosophical discussions.","2":""},"8":{"1":"I need a push to get started.","2":""},"9":{"1":"I cut others to pieces.","2":""},"10":{"1":"I make friends easily.","2":""},"11":{"1":"I feel comfortable with myself.","2":""},"12":{"1":"I often feel blue.","2":""},"13":{"1":"I am easy to satisfy.","2":""},"14":{"1":"I keep in the background.","2":""},"15":{"1":"I am always prepared.","2":""},"16":{"1":"I enjoy wild flights of fantasy.","2":""},"17":{"1":"I get stressed out easily.","2":""},"18":{"1":"I avoid contact with others.","2":""},"19":{"1":"I am not easily bothered by things.","2":""},"20":{"1":"I shirk my duties.","2":""},"21":{"1":"I can say things beautifully.","2":""},"22":{"1":"I suspect hidden motives in others.","2":""},"23":{"1":"I cheer people up.","2":""},"24":{"1":"I am not interested in abstract ideas.","2":""},"25":{"1":"I do things according to a plan.","2":""},"26":{"1":"I am concerned about others.","2":""},"27":{"1":"I am relaxed most of the time.","2":""},"28":{"1":"I waste my time.","2":""},"29":{"1":"I dont talk a lot.","2":""},"30":{"1":"I dislike myself.","2":""},"31":{"1":"I enjoy thinking about things.","2":""},"32":{"1":"I get back at others.","2":""},"33":{"1":"I warm up quickly to others.","2":""},"34":{"1":"I do not enjoy going to art museums.","2":""},"35":{"1":"I follow through with my plans.","2":""},"36":{"1":"I make people feel at ease.","2":""},"37":{"1":"I seldom feel blue.","2":""},"38":{"1":"I mess things up.","2":""},"39":{"1":"I have little to say.","2":""},"40":{"1":"I fear for the worst.","2":""},"41":{"1":"I carry the conversation to a higher level.","2":""},"42":{"1":"I believe that i am better than others.","2":""},"43":{"1":"I talk to a lot of different people at parties.","2":""},"44":{"1":"I tend to vote for conservative political candidates.","2":""},"45":{"1":"I am exacting in my work.","2":""},"46":{"1":"I accept people as they are.","2":""},"47":{"1":"I am not easily frustrated.","2":""},"48":{"1":"I dont put my mind on the task at hand.","2":""},"49":{"1":"I keep others at a distance.","2":""},"50":{"1":"I panic easily.","2":""},"51":{"1":"I tend to vote for liberal political candidates.","2":""},"52":{"1":"I contradict others.","2":""},"53":{"1":"I know how to captivate people.","2":""},"54":{"1":"I am not interested in theoretical discussions.","2":""},"55":{"1":"I make plans and stick to them.","2":""},"56":{"1":"I trust what people say.","2":""},"57":{"1":"I rarely lose my composure.","2":""},"58":{"1":"I leave things unfinished.","2":""},"59":{"1":"I dont like to draw attention to myself.","2":""},"60":{"1":"I worry about things.","2":""},"61":{"1":"I enjoy hearing new ideas.","2":""},"62":{"1":"I make demands on others.","2":""},"63":{"1":"I am the life of the party.","2":""},"64":{"1":"I have difficulty understanding abstract ideas.","2":""},"65":{"1":"I finish what i start.","2":""},"66":{"1":"I respect others.","2":""},"67":{"1":"I rarely get irritated.","2":""},"68":{"1":"I make a mess of things.","2":""},"69":{"1":"I find it difficult to approach others.","2":""},"70":{"1":"I have frequent mood swings.","2":""},"71":{"1":"I have a rich vocabulary.","2":""},"72":{"1":"I am out for my own personal gain.","2":""},"73":{"1":"I am skilled in handling social situations.","2":""},"74":{"1":"I do not like art.","2":""},"75":{"1":"I get chores done right away.","2":""},"76":{"1":"I sympathise with others feelings.","2":""},"77":{"1":"I seldom get mad.","2":""},"78":{"1":"I dont see things through.","2":""},"79":{"1":"I retreat from others.","2":""},"80":{"1":"I am often down in the dumps.","2":""},"81":{"1":"I get excited by new ideas.","2":""},"82":{"1":"I have a sharp tongue.","2":""},"83":{"1":"I feel comfortable around people.","2":""},"84":{"1":"I believe that too much tax money goes to support artists.","2":""},"85":{"1":"I pay attention to details.","2":""},"86":{"1":"I have a good word for everyone.","2":""},"87":{"1":"I remain calm under pressure.","2":""},"88":{"1":"I find it difficult to get down to work.","2":""},"89":{"1":"I would describe my experiences as somewhat dull.","2":""},"90":{"1":"I am filled with doubts about things.","2":""},"91":{"1":"I believe in the importance of art.","2":""},"92":{"1":"I insult people.","2":""},"93":{"1":"I start conversations.","2":""},"94":{"1":"I rarely look for a deeper meaning in things.","2":""},"95":{"1":"I carry out my plans.","2":""},"96":{"1":"I treat all people equally.","2":""},"97":{"1":"I am very pleased with myself.","2":""},"98":{"1":"I do just enough work to get by.","2":""},"99":{"1":"I am hard to get to know.","2":""},"100":{"1":"I feel threatened easily.","2":""}},"Randomization":"All"}},"BlockElements":[{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID596"}]}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_exEWMv9zTJbgAES","Element":"FL","PrimaryAttribute":"Survey Flow","SecondaryAttribute":null,"TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"Type":"Root","FlowID":"FL_1","Flow":[{"Type":"EmbeddedData","FlowID":"FL_1154","EmbeddedData":[{"Description":"PROLIFIC_PID","Type":"Recipient","Field":"PROLIFIC_PID","VariableType":"String","DataVisibility":[],"AnalyzeText":false},{"Description":"STUDY_ID","Type":"Recipient","Field":"STUDY_ID","VariableType":"String","DataVisibility":[],"AnalyzeText":false},{"Description":"SESSION_ID","Type":"Recipient","Field":"SESSION_ID","VariableType":"String","DataVisibility":[],"AnalyzeText":false}]},{"Type":"Standard","ID":"BL_82FFakppaimO45M","FlowID":"FL_11","Autofill":[]},{"Type":"Branch","FlowID":"FL_112","Description":"New Branch","BranchLogic":{"0":{"0":{"LogicType":"Question","QuestionID":"QID79","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID79\/SelectableChoice\/1","Operator":"NotSelected","QuestionIDFromLoc