ren.&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Please answer the question below honestly, but for the question on the next page, pick &quot;never.&quot; Anthropologists most generally classify family organization as matrilocal (a mother and her children); conjugal (a husband, his wife, and children; also called nuclear family); and consanguineal (also called an extended family) in which parents and children co-reside with other members of one parent&#39;s family.&nbsp;<\/span><\/div>\n\n<div><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">How many people are in your family?<\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>","DataExportTag":"Q6.1","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Friends and Family \u00a0 Many individuals' happiness depends on their relationship with friends and f...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"0"},"2":{"Display":"1"},"3":{"Display":"2"},"4":{"Display":"3"},"5":{"Display":"4"},"6":{"Display":"5"},"7":{"Display":"6+"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5","6","7"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":8,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID78","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><u><strong>Friends and Family<\/strong><\/u><\/span><\/span><\/div>\n\n<div><br \/>\n&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Many individuals&#39; happiness depends on their relationship with friends and family. According to Wikipedia, Ia&nbsp;<strong>family<\/strong>&nbsp;(from Latin:&nbsp;<em>familia<\/em>) is a group of people affiliated by consanguinity, affinity, or co-residence. In most societies it is the principal institution for the socialization of children.&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Please answer the question below honestly, but for the question on the next page, pick &quot;never.&quot; Anthropologists most generally classify family organization as matrilocal (a mother and her children); conjugal (a husband, his wife, and children; also called nuclear family); and consanguineal (also called an extended family) in which parents and children co-reside with other members of one parent&#39;s family.&nbsp;<\/span><\/div>\n\n<div><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">How many people are in your family?<\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_exEWMv9zTJbgAES","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID596","SecondaryAttribute":"How did this person respond to the following question?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"How did this person respond to the following question?","QuestionJS":false,"DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q589","QuestionID":"QID596","QuestionType":"Matrix","Selector":"Likert","SubSelector":"SingleAnswer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","TextPosition":"inline","ChoiceColumnWidth":25,"RepeatHeaders":"none","WhiteSpace":"OFF","MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"How did this person respond to the following question?","Choices":{"4":{"Display":"<strong><span style=\"font-size:19px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">${lm:\/\/Field\/1}<\/span><\/span><\/strong>"}},"DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"LogicType":"LoopAndMerge","LeftOperand":"BL_emR3Nfls9rXrBFc,1","RightOperand"